# Rust port build output. Cargo.lock is *not* ignored: these are binaries, and
# the lock file is what makes a release build reproducible.
rust/target/

# Evaluation corpora are derived and large — gigabytes of fastq — and live
# outside the repository under $ISONFORM_WORK. bench/corpus/README.md says how to
# rebuild each one.
#
# `sirv_small` is the exception and is tracked: 82 KB, and CI's determinism gate
# needs it. A gate that silently skips because its input is absent is worse than
# no gate.
bench/corpus/*/
!bench/corpus/sirv_small/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.eggs/

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
